store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779730/extras/e9996bd3203ec3e1c8ac89a4bbb07e80.webm?t=1756234340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779730/extras/e9996bd3203ec3e1c8ac89a4bbb07e80.mp4?t=1756234340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn the environment into a weapon</h2><i>&quot;One shot, one barrel, one big boom!&quot;</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779730/extras/14fa96d1c702ed44efa3c7bc4dd5eeaa.poster.avif?t=1756234340\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779730/extras/14fa96d1c702ed44efa3c7bc4dd5eeaa.webm?t=1756234340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779730/extras/14fa96d1c702ed44efa3c7bc4dd5eeaa.mp4?t=1756234340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic pack: 10 levels in Episode 1</h2><i>&quot;Retro FPS: Where level design confounds even architects.&quot;</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779730/extras/c1f16542a22790d590407328750a0c46.poster.avif?t=1756234340\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779730/extras/c1f16542a22790d590407328750a0c46.webm?t=1756234340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779730/extras/c1f16542a22790d590407328750a0c46.mp4?t=1756234340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview:</strong></h2>Embark on a perilous journey through a malevolent realm, blending classic FPS elements with Shoomerian myths, where madness lurks around every corner. Follow the gripping saga of a bearded soy boy character as he combats hordes of monsters. How long can you teeter on the brink of sanity? Will your testosterone surge or succumb to the grasp of misery?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Distinctive Visuals:</strong></h2>Immerse yourself in hand-drawn graphic design, resembling indie game pixel art. Elevate your gaming experience with enhanced sprites, models, and atmospheric lighting effects. Revel in the vibrant visuals, including juicy blood effects and animated gibs flying in every direction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into Madness:</strong></h2>Confront nightmares with a diverse array of weapons. Battle evolving enemies, each transforming into progressively more malevolent forms. Brace yourself, as this journey only becomes more challenging!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear up and Fight:</strong></h2>Craft your unique playstyle and build a formidable arsenal with a plethora of weapons. Choose from devastating shotguns, lethal rifles, and explosive launchers, each with potent variations designed to wreak havoc and obliterate your foes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beefy Soundtrack:</strong></h2>Immerse yourself in the dark Shoomerian atmosphere with a robust soundtrack featuring powerful electric guitar riffs and energetic drums. Slay monsters and confront ancient evils while headbanging to an original soundtrack that will keep you engaged for hours on end.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lone Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2779730/136189c47f9bac7e7f0298cb4e09ec301b58ee76.jpg"},{"name":"Hermit Socializer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2779730/67ca582661933c37167636d46c1bf18c2e806a0c.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian Diplomat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2779730/a8b2261dd375585d2a1abc8c34f008f2cb9ca077.jpg"},{"name":"Nomadic Networker","path":"htt